      "statement": "Cell phases map onto Cloudflare's Durable Object lifecycle names, with celld using 'evict' for out-of-memory (producing Dormant) and shedding for publishing a cell unowned; a Dormant cell is hibernated exactly when a surviving Hibernatable socket is present.",
