      "statement": "Cold activation walks an explicit ladder (WaitingActivation, ReadingOwner, ReadingNodeLease/RecoveringOwnerLog, capacity read/wait, Acquiring with ReconcilingAcquire for ambiguous CAS, Restoring, Starting, Publishing, Resident), and Restoring consumes a core-decided RestoreSpec so the adapter never re-discovers or guesses a restore source.",
