      "statement": "EnsuringDurability keeps the runtime published and routable while a durability proof runs, returning to Resident on failure, and a timed-out runtime start is not cancelled: the core keeps its phase until the real completion arrives so callers fail fast instead of starting a duplicate runtime.",
