    {
      "id": "claim_6a1a64506e4749e7b1a15b9a2812f7b0",
      "statement": "Concurrency is bounded by three core-held permit budgets: max_resident (hard cap from CELLD_MAX_RESIDENT_CELLS), max_activations (CELLD_ACTIVATIONS, default min(available CPUs, 128)) held across the whole cold path by a cold request while warm requests consume none, and max_evictions/max_releases (CELLD_EVICTIONS/CELLD_RELEASES) bounding durability proofs and complete shutdown handoffs.",
